sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant TS as Ticket System
    participant Triage as Triage Agent
    participant CRM as CRM System
    participant Tech as Technical Agent
    participant Billing as Billing Agent
    participant KB as KB Agent
    participant Router as Routing Agent
    participant Dest as Destination

    Customer->>TS: Submits Support Ticket
    TS->>Triage: Forward New Ticket
    
    activate Triage
    Triage->>CRM: Lookup Customer Details & History
    activate CRM
    CRM-->>Triage: Return Customer Profile & Tier
    deactivate CRM

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
    Note over Triage, KB: Parallel Execution Phase
    par Technical Analysis
        Triage->>Tech: Analyze logs & errors
        activate Tech
        Tech-->>Router: Send Technical Report
        deactivate Tech
    and Billing Analysis
        Triage->>Billing: Check invoice & payment status
        activate Billing
        Billing-->>Router: Send Billing Report
        deactivate Billing
    and Knowledge Base Search
        Triage->>KB: Search docs & FAQs
        activate KB
        KB-->>Router: Send KB Match & Confidence
        deactivate KB
    end
    end

    activate Router
    Note over Router: Evaluates confidence, urgency, and tier
    
    alt High KB Confidence / Routine
        Router->>Dest: Route to Auto-Response (~40%)
    else Moderate Complexity / Standard
        Router->>Dest: Route to Human Team (~55%)
    else Critical Urgency / VIP Tier
        Router->>Dest: Route to Escalation Queue (~5%)
    end
    deactivate Router

    Note over TS, Dest: Background SLA Escalation Agent monitors countdown timers continuously